                                                    "patching_rect": [ 50.0, 40.0, 440.0, 93.0 ],
                                                    "text": "The modulation signal passes through through two triangular (up-then-down-) waveform tables. The action of Spread will shift the input phase of the triangle~ object of the right channel. As the value of Spread is increased , the modulation of both channels will get more and more out of phase. With maximum spreading, both signals are perfectly out of phase, in which case the modulation of one channel will increase while the modulation of the other channel will decrease."
