                                                    "text": "When a voice is selected, a set of 5 arrays of \"formants\" coefficients is written into 5 audio buffers. Each array is made of 5 frequency, amplitude and bandwidth values.  Audio buffers have 3 channels (cfreq for central frequency, amp for amplitude and bw for bandwidth) and a size of 5 samples (one sample per formant). "
