                                                        "text": "cf = in1;\nQ = in2;\n\nomega = cf * twopi/samplerate;\nsn = sin(omega);\ncs = cos(omega);\nalpha = sn * 0.5/Q;\n\nb0 = 1./(1. + alpha);\na0 = alpha * b0;\na1 = 0.;\na2 = -alpha * b0;\nb1 = -2. * cs * b0;\nb2 = (1. - alpha) * b0;\n\nout1 = a0;\nout2 = a1;\nout3 = a2;\nout4 = b1;\nout5 = b2;",
